 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 485027,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "If today is a cloudy day, then there is 68% chance of rain tomorrow. If today is not cloudy, then there is only 15% chance of rain tomorrow. Build a discrete logistic regression model based on this data.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "Let <span data-math=\"p_1=0.15\"></span>, which is the probability of rain if the variable “cloudy” is false, or 0. Let <span data-math=\"p_2=0.68\"></span>, which is the probability of rain if the variable “cloudy” is true, or 1.<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\text{logit}{(p_1)}=\\text{ln}(\\frac{0.15}{1-0.15})=\\text{ln&nbsp;}0.1765=-1.7346\"></span><br>\n<span data-math=\"\\text{logit}(p_2)=\\text{ln}(\\frac{0.68}{1-0.68})=\\text{ln&nbsp;}2.125=0.7538\"></span><br>\nSo <span data-math=\"a=\\text{logit}{(p_1)}=-1.7346\"></span>, and <span data-math=\"b=\\text{logit}{(p_2)}-\\text{logit}{(p_1)}=0.7538-{(-1.7346)}=2.4884\"></span>. Therefore, the model is (rounding to 3 decimal digits):<br>\n<span data-math=\"f{(x)}=\\frac1{1+e^{-(-1.735+2.488x)}}=\\frac1{1+e^{1.735-2.488x}}\"></span>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"\\frac1{1+e^{1.735-2.488x}}\"></span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
